*   floor 1: two 65 kip heat exchangers on the line B girders at x = -20 and 20 (nodes 181, 185)
*   floor 2: four 22 kip electrical cabinets on the girders of lines 2 and 3 at y = -10 and 10
*            (nodes 210, 212, 224, 226)
*   roof:    two 25 kip air-handling units on the line B girders at x = -20 and 20 (nodes 251, 255)
